ist Bootcamp<\/h5>\n\n                            <p class=\"rating\">\n                                4.9 \u2605\u2605\u2605\u2605\u2605\n                                (6983)\n                            <\/p>\n\n                            <ul class=\"course-meta\">\n                                <li>\ud83d\udc64 18000 Learners<\/li>\n                                <li>\u23f1 6 Weeks<\/li>\n                            <\/ul>\n\n                            <div class=\"mt-3\">\n                                                                    <a href=\"https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/seo-course?utm_source=WsBlog&#038;utm_medium=blog_course_slider&#038;utm_campaign=SEO\"\n                                       target=\"_blank\"\n                                       class=\"btn view-btn btn-sm\">\n                                        View Brochure\n                                    <\/a>\n                                \n                                <a target=\"_blank\"\n                                   href=\"https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/seo-course?utm_source=WsBlog&#038;utm_medium=blog_course_slider&#038;utm_campaign=SEO\"\n                                   class=\"btn btn-outline-secondary btn-sm\">\n                                    Learn More\n                                <\/a>\n                            <\/div>\n                        <\/div>\n                    <\/div>\n\n                \n            <\/div>\n        <\/div>\n    <\/section>\n\n    \n\n\n\n<p>Some strategies include:<\/p>\n\n\n\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li>Publish valuable content that is helpful for your audience.<br><\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>Develop a useful tool and give it for free so that other publications will link to it in their content.<br><\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>Guest posts on websites that offer do follow links.<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n\n\n\n<p>However, not all do follow links carry equal weight. Search engines evaluate various factors when determining a do follow link\u2019s value, including:<\/p>\n\n\n\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li><strong>Source Authority:<\/strong> Links from high-authority, reputable sites carry more weight than low-quality or spammy sources.<br><\/li>\n\n\n\n<li><strong>Relevance:<\/strong> Links from sites in the same or related industries are generally more valuable than unrelated sources.&nbsp;<br><\/li>\n\n\n\n<li><strong>Anchor Text:<\/strong> The visible, clickable link text can provide context and relevance signals.<br><\/li>\n\n\n\n<li><strong>Link Placement:<\/strong> Links in the main content area are typically more valuable than those in the sidebar, footer, or less prominent placements.<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n\n\n\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>Common Scenarios to Use do follow Links<\/strong><\/h3>\n\n\n\n<h4 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>1. Linking to High-Quality, Relevant Content<\/strong><\/h4>\n\n\n\n<p>Use do follow links when linking to valuable, trustworthy, and relevant third-party content for your readers. This signals to search engines you endorse and vouch for the quality of the linked material. Unveil the secrets of SEO by enrolling in an <a href=\"https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/seo-course?utm_source=WsBlog&amp;utm_medium=BlogInterlink&amp;utm_campaign=traffic\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">online SEO course<\/a>.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<h4 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>2. Internal Links<\/strong><\/h4>\n\n\n\n<p>Links between pages on your own website should always be do follow. This aids search engines in understanding your site\u2019s structure and hierarchy while passing link equity.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<h4 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>3. Authoritative Sources<\/strong><\/h4>\n\n\n\n<p>When citing or referencing reputable, authoritative sources like government websites or respected publications, use do follow links to reinforce the credibility of your content.&nbsp;<\/p>\n\n\n\n<h4 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>4. Business Partners or Affiliates<\/strong><\/h4>\n\n\n\n<p>For trusted business partners or affiliates where you are not directly compensated for the link, do follow is generally acceptable if the linked content is relevant and high-quality.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<h4 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>5. Natural Editorial Links<\/strong><\/h4>\n\n\n\n<p>High-quality, naturally earned editorial links from other sites, representing a genuine endorsement based on your content\u2019s merits, should be do follow.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p><strong>Also Read:<\/strong> <a href=\"https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/on-page-seo\/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">What is On-Page SEO? Techniques &amp; How to Do<\/a><\/p>\n\n\n\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>Benefits of do follow Links for SEO<\/strong><\/h3>\n\n\n\n<p>Here are the benefits of do follow links for SEO:<\/p>\n\n\n\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li><strong>Increased Link Equity and Authority:<\/strong> Quality do follow links from authoritative, relevant sites pass significant link equity, boosting perceived authority in search engines\u2019 eyes.<br><\/li>\n\n\n\n<li><strong>Better Search Rankings: <\/strong>Accumulating valuable do follow links helps improve rankings for relevant <a href=\"https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/seo-keywords\/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">keywords in SEO<\/a> and queries.<br><\/li>\n\n\n\n<li><strong>Improved Crawlability and Indexation:<\/strong> do follow links aid search crawlers in discovering new pages, leading to better content indexation and exposure.<br><\/li>\n\n\n\n<li><strong>Referral Traffic:<\/strong> do follow links can drive targeted referral traffic from reputable sources, increasing visibility and potential conversions.<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n\n\n\n        <div class=\"container position-relative mb-2\">\n            <div class=\"row pb-4\">\n                <h2 style=\"font-size:32px\">Upcoming Masterclass<\/h2>\n                <p>Attend our live classes led by experienced and desiccated instructors of Wscube Tech.<\/p>\n            <\/div>\n            <div class=\"owl-carousel myOwl\">\n            <div class=\"item\">\n                <a href=\"https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/events\/cracking-meta-google-ads-2026-data-automation-attribution?utm_source=WsBlog&#038;utm_medium=blog_master_class_slider&#038;utm_campaign=SEO\" target=\"_blank\">\n                    <img decoding=\"async\" src=\"https:\/\/deen3evddmddt.cloudfront.net\/uploads\/master-class-media\/1a_-_2026-07-31T112145_393_1785491880854_775860.webp\" alt=\"Cracking Meta &amp; Google Ads 2026 - Data, Automation &amp; Attribution\" \/>\n                <\/a>\n            <\/div>\n            <div class=\"item\">\n                <a href=\"https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/events\/ai-engineering-roadmap-2026?utm_source=WsBlog&#038;utm_medium=blog_master_class_slider&#038;utm_campaign=SEO\" target=\"_blank\">\n                    <img decoding=\"async\" src=\"https:\/\/deen3evddmddt.cloudfront.net\/uploads\/master-class-media\/1a_-_2026-07-31T123426_340_1785490284771_211381.webp\" alt=\"AI Engineering Roadmap 2026\" \/>\n                <\/a>\n            <\/div>\n            <div class=\"item\">\n                <a href=\"https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/events\/how-to-build-an-ai-agent-from-scratch?utm_source=WsBlog&#038;utm_medium=blog_master_class_slider&#038;utm_campaign=SEO\" target=\"_blank\">\n                    <img decoding=\"async\" src=\"https:\/\/deen3evddmddt.cloudfront.net\/uploads\/master-class-media\/1a_-_2026-08-03T133829_740__1__1786010890597_768466.webp\" alt=\"How to Build an AI Agent from Scratch \" \/>\n                <\/a>\n            <\/div>\n            <div class=\"item\">\n                <a href=\"https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/events\/soc-analyst-career-demand-in-2026?utm_source=WsBlog&#038;utm_medium=blog_master_class_slider&#038;utm_campaign=SEO\" target=\"_blank\">\n                    <img decoding=\"async\" src=\"https:\/\/deen3evddmddt.cloudfront.net\/uploads\/master-class-media\/1a_-_2026-08-04T111115_404_1786011909630_974751.webp\" alt=\"SOC Analyst Career Demand in 2026\" \/>\n                <\/a>\n            <\/div>\n            <div class=\"item\">\n                <a href=\"https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/events\/booming-digital-marketing-career-in-ai-era?utm_source=WsBlog&#038;utm_medium=blog_master_class_slider&#038;utm_campaign=SEO\" target=\"_blank\">\n                    <img decoding=\"async\" src=\"https:\/\/deen3evddmddt.cloudfront.net\/uploads\/master-class-media\/1a_-_2026-08-07T104930_382_1786105407836_186872.webp\" alt=\"Booming Digital Marketing Career in AI Era\" \/>\n                <\/a>\n            <\/div>\n            <div class=\"item\">\n                <a href=\"https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/events\/cybersecurity-professional-career-roadmap-2026-2?utm_source=WsBlog&#038;utm_medium=blog_master_class_slider&#038;utm_campaign=SEO\" target=\"_blank\">\n                    <img decoding=\"async\" src=\"https:\/\/deen3evddmddt.cloudfront.net\/uploads\/master-class-media\/1a_-_2026-08-05T122121_005_1786351858212_930412.webp\" alt=\"Cybersecurity Professional Career Roadmap 2026\" \/>\n                <\/a>\n            <\/div>\n            <\/div>\n        <\/div>\n\n\n\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>How do follow Link Work?<\/strong><\/h3>\n\n\n\n<p>There\u2019s no such thing as do follow link. To make a link do follow, there\u2019s no need to do anything extra, nor does it require any unique attribute. Do follow links are default links found anywhere on a website. For example, if a link is available on your webpage linking to another web page on the same website, it\u2019s a sheer example of a do follow link.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p>Likewise, a link on a source website informs search engines to share the source site\u2019s authority with the destination website. Do-follow links work as a vote of confidence for a website. They assure that you recommend a site you point to, which increases website rank.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>What is no follow Link?<\/strong><\/h2>\n\n\n\n<p>You can insert no follow links and not have them pointing back to you. Linking to another site establishes a relationship with the website you are pointing to. However, sometimes, you want to link to a resource and not build that relationship. Adding a rel=\u201dno follow\u201d attribute to a link serves that relationship.&nbsp;<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p>Here\u2019s what a no follow link looks like:<\/p>\n\n\n\n<pre class=\"wp-block-code\"><code>&lt;a href=\"https:\/\/example.com\" rel=\"no follow\"&gt;anchor text here&lt;\/a&gt;<\/code><\/pre>\n\n\n\n<p>These links do not boost PageRank or help with better placement on <a href=\"https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/serp\/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">SERP (search engine result page)<\/a>. Therefore, a no follow link from your website to another or vice versa do not pass link equity to the website it\u2019s pointing to. Hence, search engines won\u2019t follow that link as they crawl the website and won\u2019t assign any value to that link.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>Impact of no follow Links on SEO<\/strong><\/h3>\n\n\n\n<p>The impact that no follow links have on SEO are:<\/p>\n\n\n\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li>Drives relevant traffic to your website. This is possible when people decide to follow the link.<br><\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>Results in residual do follow links from other publications that identify that link and wish to link to it as a do follow link.<br><\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>Help boost brand awareness.<br><\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>Useful in building a natural link portfolio.<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n\n\n\n<p>As you can see, no follow links aren\u2019t totally worthless. They positively impact your SEO, although it\u2019s mostly indirect.&nbsp;<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"has-white-color has-vivid-cyan-blue-background-color has-text-color has-background has-link-color wp-elements-3568cff12edd1091b5a414a